{
  "id": "block-editor-tutorial",
  "title": "Welcome to Frontend Observability",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "In this guide, we'll walk you through Grafana Cloud Frontend Observability. You will learn how to navigate through the Frontend Observability application and how to send metrics to your first dashboard.\n\nYou can follow along with the video below."
    },
    {
      "type": "video",
      "src": "https://youtube.com/embed/AfVDnsriwXQ",
      "provider": "youtube",
      "title": "Getting Started With Frontend Observability",
      "start": 174,
      "end": 274
    },
    {
      "type": "section",
      "id": "guide-section-84199",
      "title": "Navigate Around Frontend Observability",
